"Space. Ctrl+Alt+H switches the frame on or off at any time."
msgstr "辅助框会标出当前具有键盘焦点的控件，便于使用 Tab、方向键、Enter 和空格键操作 Organizer。可随时按 Ctrl+Alt+H 开关此框。"

#, python-format
msgid ""
"The holiday service is unavailable. Is there an internet connection? (%s)"
msgstr "节假日服务不可用。是否已连接互联网？（%s）"

#, python-format
