msgid ""
"vCard preserves more contact details. LDIF is intended for importing into "
"Claws Mail; emergency contacts, social media, free labels and non-JPEG "
"photos cannot be included."
msgstr "vCard 可保留更多联系人详细信息。LDIF 用于导入 Claws Mail；无法包含紧急联系人、社交媒体、自定义标签和非 JPEG 照片。vCard preserves more contact details. LDIF is intended for importing into Claws Mail; emergency contacts, social media, free labels and non-JPEG photos cannot be included."

